         Lab 6 build.  Her Day 11x slides 20 and 21 (the table discussion, and
         decoding shaft position, dtheta = 2*pi/#slots) were moved here whole at
         Day 11x's Gate 1; see reviews/day11x-gate1.md.

         REQUIRED at Day 12's Gate 0: Lab 6 p.5 says students derive
         RPM = 60 x PPS / 20 "in the reading quiz".  Day 11x has no pre-class
         reading, so that derivation has to live in Day 12's Before Class section
         or it is stranded.

         Do not reconstruct driver code from memory (B-6). -->


</chapter>
